<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yuhana Filana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2YU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yuhana Filana</para>
  <para style="mt">Yuhana Filana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Foli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Sɛbɛ ɲin farani lemɛniya mɔɔilu la dɛkuru mɔɔbakɔrɔ le la. N ye a lawala n badenmuso ma, Alla ka mɛn suwandi, a ni a denilu. Ai bɛɛ duman n yɛ, baa an bɛɛ ye taamanna ka bɛn Alla la tuɲa la ma. Kɔni n kelen tɛ. Mɛnilu ka tuɲa wo lɔn, ai duman woilu bɛɛ yɛ. <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />An ye ai kaninna ka a masɔrɔn Alla la tuɲa ye an ni ai bɛɛ jusu rɔ. A ri to an jusu rɔ kadawu.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />An Fa Alla ni a Dencɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin di hina yiraka an na, ka kininkinin an ma, ka jususuma di an ma. Ii ri woilu bɛɛ kɛ an yɛ, andeilu mɛnilu ye taamanna ka bɛn Alla la tuɲa ma, ka i ɲɔɔn kanin.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuɲa ni Kaninteya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />N sɛwani kosɛbɛ, baa n ka i den doilu yen, ii ye taamanna ka bɛn Alla la tuɲa ma ikomin an Fa Alla ka a fɔ an yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Awa, n badenmuso, n ye i madiyala sisɛn ko an bɛɛ ye i ɲɔɔn kanin. N ye mɛn sɛbɛla ɲin di, jamarili kura tɛ wo ri, baa wo fɔni an yɛ kɛbi a damira waati. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Ka i ɲɔɔn kanin, wo tɛ foyi ri fɔɔ ka Alla la jamariliilu labato. Ai ka jamarili mɛn mɛn kɛbi a damira waati, wo le ɲin di: Ai ye kaninteya sila taama.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Mɔɔ lafilila ka siya dunuɲa rɔ sisɛn. Woilu le tɛ ii lɔla a la ko Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin nara dunuɲa rɔ ka kɛ adamaden di. Mɔɔ su wo ye mɔɔ lafilila le ri, a ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin juu. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye a kɛ koɲuma, sa ai kana bɔnɔ ai la baara tɔnɔ rɔ fɔɔ ka wo baarayi dafanin sɔrɔn.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Mɔɔ mɛn tɛ tola Ɲenematɔmɔnin na karan kan fɔɔ ka a ta la a kan, Alla tɛ wo tii dafɛ. Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn toni Ɲenematɔmɔnin na karan kan, Fa Alla ni a Dencɛ fila bɛɛ ye wo tii dafɛ.<verse eid="2JN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Ni mɔɔ do nara ai wara, mɛn na karan ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta tɛ kelen di, ai kana wo tii lajiya ai wara. Hali ka a fo, ai kana sɔn wo ma, <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />baa ni mɔɔ mɛn ka mɔɔ su wo fo, wo tii ra don mɔɔ wo la kɛwali juuilu rɔ.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Nba, kuma siyaman ye n fɛ ka a fɔ ai yɛ, kɔni n tɛ a fɛ ka wo bɛɛ kɛ sɛbɛli ri. A lɔɔ ye n na ka wa bɔ ai fɛ, ka kuma ai yɛ ɲa ni ɲa. Ni wo kɛra, an na sɛwa ri kɛ sɛwa dafanin di.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Nba, Alla ka i badenma muso mɛn fanan suwandi yan, wo denilu ye i fola.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>